OL,3,GNEWSA'I was dead for 10 minutes, but
OL,4,Alived to tell the tale'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn New Year's Eve of 2019 Sandra
OL,7,FMcCartney was clinically dead for 10
OL,8,Fminutes.
OL,10,FShe was 59 when she collapsed during a
OL,11,FChristmas holiday in Spain, lost
OL,12,Fconsciousness, stopped breathing and
OL,13,Fhad no pulse or heartbeat after
OL,14,Fsuffering a cardiac arrest.
OL,16,FSandra's life was saved when medics
OL,17,Fmanaged to restore a normal heart
OL,18,Frhythm during a frantic race against
OL,19,Ftime when paramedics gave her "six
OL,20,Fdefibrillator shocks and five shots of
OL,21,Fadrenaline to save my life".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
