OL,3,GNEWSA'I was dead for 10 minutes, but
OL,4,Alived to tell the tale'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer life may have been turned upside
OL,7,Fdown in that moment but she believes
OL,8,Fshe had been living with a ticking time
OL,9,Fbomb long before that.
